inputs/*.txt
reference/

# Full annotated listings (scripts/intcode_disasm.rkt --full). Every cell of
# the program appears verbatim, so committing one would republish a puzzle
# input that inputs/*.txt above deliberately keeps out of the repo. Generate
# locally instead:
#   racket scripts/intcode_disasm.rkt inputs/dayNN.txt --full > Problem_Statements/days/dayNN_listing.md
Problem_Statements/days/*_listing.md

# Racket build artifacts
compiled/
*.zo
*.dep

